; ============================================================
; TITLE:    Vicsek Fractals
; CATEGORY: Fractals
; LEVEL:    Intermediate
; TAGS:     recursion, squares, crosses, FILLED, lists of positions
; SUMMARY:  Builds a plus-shaped and an X-shaped Vicsek fractal from five smaller copies each.
; ============================================================
;
; WHAT IT DOES
;   Split a square into a 3 by 3 grid and keep only five of the nine
;   pieces. Keep the middle and the four edges and you get a cross
;   that turns into a snowflake. Keep the middle and the four
;   corners and you get a cloud of X shapes. Both are drawn side by
;   side from the same procedure.
;
; HOW TO USE
;   Press Run. Edit the lists of cells to invent your own fractals.
;
; CONCEPTS YOU WILL LEARN
;   * describing a pattern with a list of [column row] pairs
;   * FOREACH with FIRST and LAST to unpack each pair
;   * passing a list down through the recursion
;
; THINGS TO TRY
;   * Use [[0 0] [2 2] [1 1]] for a diagonal line of squares.
;   * Keep six cells and see a new pattern.
;   * Give each level its own color.
; ============================================================

; BLOCK paints a square with its bottom left corner at (x, y).
to block :x :y :size :color
  penup setxy :x :y setheading 0
  filled :color [repeat 4 [forward :size right 90]]
end

; VICSEK splits the square into thirds and recurses into the cells
; listed in :cells. Each cell is a list [column row] from 0 to 2.
to vicsek :x :y :size :depth :cells :color
  if :depth = 0 [block :x :y :size :color stop]
  localmake "third :size / 3
  foreach :cells [
    vicsek :x + :third * first ? :y + :third * last ? ~
      :third :depth - 1 :cells :color
  ]
end

; CAPTION writes text under a fractal.
to caption :x :text
  penup setxy :x - 4 * count :text -230 pendown
  setpencolor [60 60 60]
  label :text
end

clearscreen hideturtle
setbackground [250 250 250]
make "plus [[1 1] [0 1] [2 1] [1 0] [1 2]]
make "cross [[1 1] [0 0] [2 0] [0 2] [2 2]]
vicsek -370 -162 324 4 :plus [20 110 200]
vicsek 46 -162 324 4 :cross [210 70 90]
setlabelheight 16
caption -208 "cross
caption 208 "saltire
